cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LinearKnot, please cite this software release."
type: software
title: "LinearKnot: fixed-scaffold RNA pseudoknot ensembles, prediction, and accessibility"
authors:
  - family-names: Otagaki
    given-names: Takumi
version: 0.2.3
repository-code: "https://github.com/TakumiOtagaki/LinearKnot"
url: "https://github.com/TakumiOtagaki/LinearKnot"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  LinearKnot computes density-2 RNA pseudoknot ensembles conditioned on a
  pseudoknot-free scaffold. It provides structure prediction, base-pair
  probabilities, accessibility, loop profiles, sampling, suboptimal structures,
  MEA, and centroid decoding, with exact and beam modes.
keywords:
  - RNA
  - pseudoknots
  - partition function
  - accessibility
